cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use APPlace in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: "APPlace: an analytical placer for analog layout"
abstract: >-
  APPlace is a routing-aware analytical placement framework for analog circuits.
  It co-optimizes device locations and access points during global placement, and
  preserves the resulting structure through legalization. This repository contains
  the Rust implementation of the placement flow and four runnable example designs.
